    "description": "Dive into the thrilling universe of trucks with an addictive Match-3 puzzle game.\r\n\r\nEmbark on a journey of unmatched realism and experience the exhilaration of Truck Simulator, all within a single game.\r\n\r\nExperience a unique blend of simulation and tycoon gameplay for an unparalleled gaming experience.\r\n\r\nPersonalize your trucks with customizable lights, bumpers, horns, and more!\r\n\r\nAssemble the ultimate fleet of trucks you've always dreamed of.\r\n\r\nStay tuned for frequent updates and more exciting features!",
